---
/**
 * Explains the verified/needs_review system before a visitor hits a wall of
 * "Unconfirmed" badges and assumes the site is broken. Placed once, above
 * any table that uses <ProvenanceBadge>.
 */
---

<p class="callout">
  <strong>Why some rows say "Unconfirmed":</strong> every value here is tagged with
  where it came from and how sure we are of it. "Unconfirmed" doesn't mean it's
  wrong — it means we haven't independently cross-checked it against the
  manufacturer or AHRI yet, so we're telling you that instead of presenting it as
  settled fact. That's on purpose: we'd rather flag an unverified number than
  guess and be wrong.
</p>
